                <mxCell id="note" value="Errors:&lt;br/&gt;• 401 if JWT missing/invalid (handled by current_user_claims).&lt;br/&gt;• If MODELS_DIR is empty, returns []. No 500.&lt;br/&gt;• Individual malformed manifest → 500 with the offending architecture in the log; partial responses are NOT served." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#444444;" parent="1" vertex="1">
